{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/extras/6eb3e81df2b15a0f1285a26e2a0b3e05.avif?t=1768841839\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a dreadful <strong>infection</strong> spread throughout the land. You join a government operation to help what's left of pony-kind. You will be required to venture out into the infected landscape and complete tasks, all while staying in one piece. You can earn money for each task completed, and use that money to purchase goods. The more tasks you complete, the more challenging they become. Simply because we know you\u2019re up to the challenge!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/extras/58b71215106da0d8387011dc66eaffe3.poster.avif?t=1768841839\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/extras/58b71215106da0d8387011dc66eaffe3.webm?t=1768841839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/extras/58b71215106da0d8387011dc66eaffe3.mp4?t=1768841839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/extras/4f97b041d9dc4131fcfac8ed15a021e1.avif?t=1768841839\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Were you really thinking about going out there <strong>ALONE</strong>? Why not drag your friends down with you? Nothing is stronger than the bond of friendship! Having someone to watch your back might save your life! Nothing brings friends closer together like a little danger! Stick together and you will all be alright! (Probably.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922920?t=1768841839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/4a07169f32cea45547e752e357da2070d671c0f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768841839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/a5dca727003a69722175eaed9fdc595d1b737de8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768841839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/a5dca727003a69722175eaed9fdc595d1b737de8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768841839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains violence along with aspects of body horror. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922920/extras/6eb3e81df2b15a0f1285a26e2a0b3e05.avif?t=1768841839\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a dreadful <strong>infection</strong> spread throughout the land. You join a government operation to help what's left of pony-kind. You will be required to venture out into the infected landscape and complete tasks, all while staying in one piece. You can earn money for each task completed, and use that money to purchase goods. The more tasks you complete, the more challenging they become. Simply because we know you\u2019re up to the challenge!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img